message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. 若使用本作，请按下述格式引用。"
type: book
title: "区分的演化：从图论硬核到统一纲领——公理框架、可复现结果与限度宣言 / The Evolution of Distinction: From a Graph-Theoretic Hard Core to a Program for Unification"
abstract: >-
  本书把"抽象统摄具体"写成可操作的方法（压缩），把它实现为一个形式框架——
  演化区分系统（EDS），并在有限图上给出一个完整、可复现的相变定理：区分耦合越过
  两个由拉普拉斯谱决定的临界值时，系统经历"局部先于全局"的两阶段相变。它同时
  公开挂出一个未解决的缺口——分离曲率与 Gauss–Bonnet 定理之间的因子 1/3——作为
  可攻击的研究目标。English: This monograph formalizes "abstraction subsuming the
  concrete" as compression, realizes it as the Evolutionary Distinction System (EDS),
  and proves a fully rigorous, reproducible two-stage phase transition on finite
  graphs — while openly exposing an unsolved factor-of-1/3 gap between separation
  curvature and the Gauss–Bonnet theorem as an attackable research target.
